#
# NovatOS package list (x86_64) — Lean Hyprland Edition
# ======================================================
# Design goals:
#   - Hyprland desktop (~250MB RAM, Windows 11-style with waybar + wofi)
#   - bauh app store (AUR + Flatpak + Snap + AppImage — one-click installs)
#   - NO heavy pre-installed apps (Steam, LibreOffice, etc. → via bauh)
#   - All GPU drivers (AMD, Intel, NVIDIA) + software rendering fallback
#   - 2009-2026 hardware support (linux-lts kernel)
#   - BIOS + UEFI hybrid boot
#   - Target ISO size: ~2-2.5 GB
#

# ---------- Base system ----------
base
base-devel
linux
linux-lts
linux-zen
linux-firmware
linux-firmware-marvell
amd-ucode
intel-ucode
arch-install-scripts
pacman
pacman-contrib
reflector
haveged

# ---------- CRITICAL: archiso + mkinitcpio-archiso (live-boot hooks) ----------
archiso
mkinitcpio-archiso
mkinitcpio-nfs-utils
nbd

# ---------- Filesystem / storage ----------
